<title>USA: Winchester Mining names Birch CFO.</title>
<headline>Winchester Mining names Birch CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winchester Mining Corp said on Thursday that it appointed Ron Birch to the position of executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Birch will also serve as a member of the company's board of directors effective immediately.</p>
<p>Birch has held various posts in investment finance, international banking and securities consulting.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
